7\u30fc\u3068\u540d\u4e57\u308a\u3001\u8857\u3078\u3068\u3084\u3063\u3066\u304d\u305f\u30b8\u30e7\u30fc\u306f\u9b54\u6cd5\u4f7f\u3044\u3068\u3057\u3066\u6271\u308f\u308c\u3001\u30a8\u30eb\u30d5\u3084\u30c9\u30ef\u30fc\u30d5\u3001\u30ae\u30eb\u30c9\u306e\u4eba\u3005\u3068\u51fa\u4f1a\u3046\u3002\u30b8\u30e7\u30fc\u306e\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305f\u88c5\u5099\u3084\u98df\u7ce7\u304c\u8a71\u984c\u3092\u96c6\u3081\u308b\u306a\u304b\u3001\u30ef\u30a4\u30d0\u30fc\u30f3\u6025\u8972\u306e\u5831\u304c\u5165\u308a\u2026\uff01\uff1f","pt-br":"Jinguji Jo, um candidato \u00e0 For\u00e7a de Autodefesa, que acabou de se formar, reencarnou em um mundo diferente por causa de um acidente no tr\u00e2nsito. Jinguji Jo ganha a habilidade \"invent\u00e1rio\", onde permite guardar qualquer coisa, assim ele percebe que seu equipamento da for\u00e7a de autodefesa est\u00e1 l\u00e1. A a\u00e7\u00e3o de Jinguji Jo neste novo mundo \u00e9 imprescind\u00edvel, combatendo criaturas fantasiosas com equipamentos mais poderosos que a pr\u00f3pria magia!!!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"175995","ap":"bocchi-jieikan-no-isekai-funsenki","bl":"1035370","bw":"series\/327650","kt":"bocchi-jieikan-no-isekai-funsenki","mu":"li3u7xb","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0B3N337VC","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/667978\/","mal":"161930","raw":"https:\/\/comic-boost.com\/series\/295"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"ongoing","year":2021,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"0bc90acb-ccc1-44ca-a34a-b9f3a73259d0","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Reincarnation"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"36fd93ea-e8b8-445e-b836-358f02b3d33d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Monsters"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"desc